# Deploy

# 1\. Tag the commit the installer was built from

```
git tag -a v0.1.26 -m "Trundler 0.1.26"
git push origin v0.1.26
```

# 2\. Create the release and attach the installer

```
gh release create v0.1.26 \
  "dist/Trundler Setup 0.1.26.exe" \
  "dist/Trundler Setup 0.1.26.exe.blockmap" \
  "dist/latest.yml" \
  --repo auckland-ai-collective/trundler \
  --title "Trundler 0.1.26" \
  --notes "Model picker with tabbed settings, Ollama tool-calling detection, on-special pricing, favourites, out-of-stock handling."
```
